    "Clicks and keystrokes are drawn on screen in full-screen and region recordings. In window and app recordings they are added to the video, together with the webcam, after you stop recording. Keystrokes need Input Monitoring permission; with “Only show shortcuts” on, plain typing such as passwords is never shown." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Clicks and keystrokes are drawn on screen in full-screen and region recordings. In window and app recordings they are added to the video, together with the webcam, after you stop recording. Keystrokes need Input Monitoring permission; with “Only show shortcuts” on, plain typing such as passwords is never shown."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تُرسم النقرات وضغطات المفاتيح على الشاشة في تسجيلات ملء الشاشة والمنطقة. أما في تسجيلات النافذة والتطبيق فتُضاف إلى الفيديو مع كاميرا الويب بعد إيقاف التسجيل. تتطلب ضغطات المفاتيح إذن مراقبة الإدخال؛ وعند تفعيل “إظهار الاختصارات فقط” لا تُعرض الكتابة العادية مثل كلمات السر أبدًا."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Clicks and keystrokes are drawn on screen in full-screen and region recordings. In window and app recordings they are added to the video, together with the webcam, after you stop recording. Keystrokes need Input Monitoring permission; with “Only show shortcuts” on, plain typing such as passwords is never shown."
          }
        },
