    "Finds stretches where the audio stays quiet and the picture barely changes, then removes them or plays them faster. With “Trim recordings before saving” on, the trim window shows the cuts on the timeline before anything is changed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Finds stretches where the audio stays quiet and the picture barely changes, then removes them or plays them faster. With “Trim recordings before saving” on, the trim window shows the cuts on the timeline before anything is changed."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يعثر على المقاطع التي يبقى فيها الصوت هادئًا وبالكاد تتغير الصورة، ثم يزيلها أو يشغّلها بسرعة أكبر. عند تشغيل “قص التسجيلات قبل الحفظ”، تعرض نافذة القص المقاطع المحذوفة على الخط الزمني قبل تغيير أي شيء."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Finds stretches where the audio stays quiet and the picture barely changes, then removes them or plays them faster. With “Trim recordings before saving” on, the trim window shows the cuts on the timeline before anything is changed."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Finds stretches where the audio stays quiet and the picture barely changes, then removes them or plays them faster. With “Trim recordings before saving” on, the trim window shows the cuts on the timeline before anything is changed."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Finds stretches where the audio stays quiet and the picture barely changes, then removes them or plays them faster. With “Trim recordings before saving” on, the trim window shows the cuts on the timeline before anything is changed."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Findet Abschnitte, in denen der Ton leise bleibt und sich das Bild kaum ändert, und entfernt sie oder spielt sie schneller ab. Ist „Aufnahmen vor dem Sichern trimmen“ aktiviert, zeigt das Trimmfenster die Schnitte in der Zeitleiste, bevor etwas geändert wird."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Finds stretches where the audio stays quiet and the picture barely changes, then removes them or plays them faster. With “Trim recordings before saving” on, the trim window shows the cuts on the timeline before anything is changed."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Busca tramos en los que el audio permanece en silencio y la imagen apenas cambia, y los elimina o los reproduce más rápido. Con “Recortar grabaciones antes de guardar” activado, la ventana de recorte muestra los cortes en la línea de tiempo antes de modificar nada."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Finds stretches where the audio stays quiet and the picture barely changes, then removes them or plays them faster. With “Trim recordings before saving” on, the trim window shows the cuts on the timeline before anything is changed."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Repère les passages où le son reste faible et l'image change à peine, puis les supprime ou les accélère. Si « Découper les enregistrements avant de les enregistrer » est activé, la fenêtre de découpage affiche les coupes sur la timeline avant toute modification."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Finds stretches where the audio stays quiet and the picture barely changes, then removes them or plays them faster. With “Trim recordings before saving” on, the trim window shows the cuts on the timeline before anything is changed."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Finds stretches where the audio stays quiet and the picture barely changes, then removes them or plays them faster. With “Trim recordings before saving” on, the trim window shows the cuts on the timeline before anything is changed."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Finds stretches where the audio stays quiet and the picture barely changes, then removes them or plays them faster. With “Trim recordings before saving” on, the trim window shows the cuts on the timeline before anything is changed."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "音声が静かで映像がほとんど変化しない区間を見つけ、削除するか早送りで再生します。「保存前に収録をトリミング」がオンの場合は、変更が加えられる前にトリミングウインドウのタイムライン上にカット箇所が表示されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "오디오가 조용하고 화면이 거의 바뀌지 않는 구간을 찾아 제거하거나 빠르게 재생합니다. ‘저장 전에 녹화 다듬기’가 켜져 있으면 변경하기 전에 다듬기 윈도우의 타임라인에 잘라낼 부분이 표시됩니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Finds stretches where the audio stays quiet and the picture barely changes, then removes them or plays them faster. With “Trim recordings before saving” on, the trim window shows the cuts on the timeline before anything is changed."
          }
        },
