    "Removes or speeds up stretches where it's quiet and the picture barely changes. Red parts are cut, blue parts play faster." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Removes or speeds up stretches where it's quiet and the picture barely changes. Red parts are cut, blue parts play faster."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يزيل المقاطع الهادئة التي بالكاد تتغير فيها الصورة أو يسرّعها. تُقص الأجزاء الحمراء، وتُشغَّل الأجزاء الزرقاء بسرعة أكبر."
          }
        },
