        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tam ekranı veya bir bölgeyi kaydederken kalem, vurgulayıcı veya okla çizmek için kısayola bas. Çizimin kaydın bir parçası olur ama ekran görüntülerinde asla yer almaz. Kullandığın uygulamaya dönmek için Esc’ye veya kısayola yeniden bas."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Під час запису всього екрана або області натисніть сполучення клавіш, щоб малювати пером, маркером або стрілкою. Ваш малюнок буде частиною запису, але ніколи не потрапить на знімки екрана. Натисніть Esc або сполучення клавіш ще раз, щоб повернутися до застосунку, яким ви користувалися."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "While recording the full screen or a region, press the shortcut to draw with a pen, highlighter or arrow. Your drawing is part of the recording but never of screenshots. Press Esc or the shortcut again to go back to the app you were using."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "录制全屏或区域时，按下快捷键即可用钢笔、荧光笔或箭头绘图。你的绘图会成为录制内容的一部分，但绝不会出现在截图中。按 Esc 或再次按下快捷键可返回你之前使用的应用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "While recording the full screen or a region, press the shortcut to draw with a pen, highlighter or arrow. Your drawing is part of the recording but never of screenshots. Press Esc or the shortcut again to go back to the app you were using."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While selecting, press A to cycle aspect ratios, F to cycle fixed sizes and S to type a size such as 800x600. Hold ⌘ or press + to keep several regions, then press Return to capture them all. Tab switches between a frozen and a live screen. Capture Menu… counts down three seconds so you can open a menu, popover or tooltip first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "While selecting, press A to cycle aspect ratios, F to cycle fixed sizes and S to type a size such as 800x600. Hold ⌘ or press + to keep several regions, then press Return to capture them all. Tab switches between a frozen and a live screen. Capture Menu… counts down three seconds so you can open a menu, popover or tooltip first."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "أثناء التحديد، اضغط A للتنقل بين نسب العرض إلى الارتفاع، وF للتنقل بين الأحجام الثابتة، وS لكتابة حجم مثل 800x600. اضغط مع الاستمرار على ⌘ أو اضغط + للاحتفاظ بعدة مناطق، ثم اضغط Return لالتقاطها جميعًا. يبدّل Tab بين شاشة مجمّدة وشاشة مباشرة. يعدّ التقاط قائمة… ثلاث ثوانٍ تنازليًا لتتمكن من فتح قائمة أو نافذة منبثقة أو تلميح أولًا."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "While selecting, press A to cycle aspect ratios, F to cycle fixed sizes and S to type a size such as 800x600. Hold ⌘ or press + to keep several regions, then press Return to capture them all. Tab switches between a frozen and a live screen. Capture Menu… counts down three seconds so you can open a menu, popover or tooltip first."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "While selecting, press A to cycle aspect ratios, F to cycle fixed sizes and S to type a size such as 800x600. Hold ⌘ or press + to keep several regions, then press Return to capture them all. Tab switches between a frozen and a live screen. Capture Menu… counts down three seconds so you can open a menu, popover or tooltip first."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "While selecting, press A to cycle aspect ratios, F to cycle fixed sizes and S to type a size such as 800x600. Hold ⌘ or press + to keep several regions, then press Return to capture them all. Tab switches between a frozen and a live screen. Capture Menu… counts down three seconds so you can open a menu, popover or tooltip first."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Drücke während der Auswahl A, um Seitenverhältnisse durchzuschalten, F für feste Größen und S, um eine Größe wie 800x600 einzugeben. Halte ⌘ oder drücke +, um mehrere Bereiche zu behalten, und drücke dann Return, um alle aufzunehmen. Tab wechselt zwischen eingefrorenem und Live-Bildschirm. „Menü aufnehmen …“ zählt drei Sekunden herunter, damit du zuerst ein Menü, Popover oder einen Tooltip öffnen kannst."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "While selecting, press A to cycle aspect ratios, F to cycle fixed sizes and S to type a size such as 800x600. Hold ⌘ or press + to keep several regions, then press Return to capture them all. Tab switches between a frozen and a live screen. Capture Menu… counts down three seconds so you can open a menu, popover or tooltip first."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Al seleccionar, pulsa A para alternar entre proporciones, F para alternar entre tamaños fijos y S para escribir un tamaño como 800x600. Mantén ⌘ o pulsa + para conservar varias regiones y, a continuación, pulsa Return para capturarlas todas. Tab alterna entre una pantalla congelada y una en directo. Capturar menú… hace una cuenta atrás de tres segundos para que puedas abrir antes un menú, un popover o un tooltip."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "While selecting, press A to cycle aspect ratios, F to cycle fixed sizes and S to type a size such as 800x600. Hold ⌘ or press + to keep several regions, then press Return to capture them all. Tab switches between a frozen and a live screen. Capture Menu… counts down three seconds so you can open a menu, popover or tooltip first."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pendant la sélection, appuyez sur A pour parcourir les formats, F pour parcourir les tailles fixes et S pour saisir une taille comme 800x600. Maintenez ⌘ ou appuyez sur + pour conserver plusieurs zones, puis appuyez sur Return pour toutes les capturer. Tab bascule entre un écran figé et un écran en direct. « Capturer un menu… » lance un compte à rebours de trois secondes pour vous permettre d'ouvrir d'abord un menu, une fenêtre contextuelle ou une infobulle."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "While selecting, press A to cycle aspect ratios, F to cycle fixed sizes and S to type a size such as 800x600. Hold ⌘ or press + to keep several regions, then press Return to capture them all. Tab switches between a frozen and a live screen. Capture Menu… counts down three seconds so you can open a menu, popover or tooltip first."
          }
        },
