            "value" : "With any of these on, ishare draws the pointer itself after you stop recording instead of recording the system pointer, so it always appears as an arrow. Click ripples replace “Record clicks”."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bunlardan herhangi biri açıkken ishare, sistem imlecini kaydetmek yerine kaydı durdurduktan sonra imleci kendisi çizer; bu nedenle imleç her zaman ok olarak görünür. Tıklama dalgaları “Tıklamaları kaydet”in yerini alır."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Якщо ввімкнено будь-що з цього, ishare сам малює вказівник після зупинки запису замість запису системного вказівника, тому він завжди має вигляд стрілки. Хвилі від клацань замінюють «Записувати клацання»."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With any of these on, ishare draws the pointer itself after you stop recording instead of recording the system pointer, so it always appears as an arrow. Click ripples replace “Record clicks”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启其中任意一项后，ishare 会在停止录制后自行绘制指针，而不是录制系统指针，因此指针始终显示为箭头。点按波纹会取代“录制点按”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With any of these on, ishare draws the pointer itself after you stop recording instead of recording the system pointer, so it always appears as an arrow. Click ripples replace “Record clicks”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With automatic scrolling, ishare scrolls the area you selected by sending scroll events to it, so long pages are captured without scrolling by hand. macOS lists this permission under Accessibility. ishare asks for it only when you turn this on and uses it for nothing else. Without it, you scroll yourself and ishare captures as you go." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With automatic scrolling, ishare scrolls the area you selected by sending scroll events to it, so long pages are captured without scrolling by hand. macOS lists this permission under Accessibility. ishare asks for it only when you turn this on and uses it for nothing else. Without it, you scroll yourself and ishare captures as you go."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "مع التمرير التلقائي، يمرّر ishare المنطقة التي حددتها بإرسال أحداث تمرير إليها، فتُلتقط الصفحات الطويلة دون التمرير يدويًا. يدرج macOS هذا الإذن ضمن تسهيلات الاستخدام. لا يطلبه ishare إلا عند تفعيل هذا الخيار ولا يستخدمه لأي غرض آخر. بدونه، تمرّر أنت ويلتقط ishare أثناء ذلك."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With automatic scrolling, ishare scrolls the area you selected by sending scroll events to it, so long pages are captured without scrolling by hand. macOS lists this permission under Accessibility. ishare asks for it only when you turn this on and uses it for nothing else. Without it, you scroll yourself and ishare captures as you go."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With automatic scrolling, ishare scrolls the area you selected by sending scroll events to it, so long pages are captured without scrolling by hand. macOS lists this permission under Accessibility. ishare asks for it only when you turn this on and uses it for nothing else. Without it, you scroll yourself and ishare captures as you go."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With automatic scrolling, ishare scrolls the area you selected by sending scroll events to it, so long pages are captured without scrolling by hand. macOS lists this permission under Accessibility. ishare asks for it only when you turn this on and uses it for nothing else. Without it, you scroll yourself and ishare captures as you go."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Beim automatischen Scrollen scrollt ishare den ausgewählten Bereich, indem es Scroll-Ereignisse sendet, sodass lange Seiten ohne manuelles Scrollen aufgenommen werden. macOS führt diese Berechtigung unter Bedienungshilfen. ishare fragt nur danach, wenn du diese Option einschaltest, und nutzt sie für nichts anderes. Ohne sie scrollst du selbst und ishare nimmt dabei auf."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With automatic scrolling, ishare scrolls the area you selected by sending scroll events to it, so long pages are captured without scrolling by hand. macOS lists this permission under Accessibility. ishare asks for it only when you turn this on and uses it for nothing else. Without it, you scroll yourself and ishare captures as you go."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Con el desplazamiento automático, ishare desplaza el área seleccionada enviándole eventos de desplazamiento, para capturar páginas largas sin desplazarte a mano. macOS incluye este permiso en Accesibilidad. ishare solo lo solicita cuando activas esta opción y no lo usa para nada más. Sin él, te desplazas tú e ishare captura mientras tanto."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With automatic scrolling, ishare scrolls the area you selected by sending scroll events to it, so long pages are captured without scrolling by hand. macOS lists this permission under Accessibility. ishare asks for it only when you turn this on and uses it for nothing else. Without it, you scroll yourself and ishare captures as you go."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avec le défilement automatique, ishare fait défiler la zone sélectionnée en lui envoyant des événements de défilement, pour capturer les longues pages sans faire défiler à la main. macOS classe cette autorisation dans Accessibilité. ishare ne la demande que lorsque vous activez cette option et ne l’utilise pour rien d’autre. Sans elle, vous faites défiler vous‑même et ishare capture au fur et à mesure."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With automatic scrolling, ishare scrolls the area you selected by sending scroll events to it, so long pages are captured without scrolling by hand. macOS lists this permission under Accessibility. ishare asks for it only when you turn this on and uses it for nothing else. Without it, you scroll yourself and ishare captures as you go."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With automatic scrolling, ishare scrolls the area you selected by sending scroll events to it, so long pages are captured without scrolling by hand. macOS lists this permission under Accessibility. ishare asks for it only when you turn this on and uses it for nothing else. Without it, you scroll yourself and ishare captures as you go."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With automatic scrolling, ishare scrolls the area you selected by sending scroll events to it, so long pages are captured without scrolling by hand. macOS lists this permission under Accessibility. ishare asks for it only when you turn this on and uses it for nothing else. Without it, you scroll yourself and ishare captures as you go."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自動スクロールでは、ishareが選択した範囲にスクロールイベントを送ってスクロールするため、長いページも手動でスクロールせずにキャプチャできます。macOSではこの許可は「アクセシビリティ」に表示されます。ishareはこの設定をオンにしたときだけ許可を求め、ほかの目的には使用しません。許可がない場合は、自分でスクロールするとishareが随時キャプチャします。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "자동 스크롤을 사용하면 ishare가 선택한 영역에 스크롤 이벤트를 보내 스크롤하므로 긴 페이지를 직접 스크롤하지 않고 캡처할 수 있습니다. macOS는 이 권한을 손쉬운 사용 항목에 표시합니다. ishare는 이 옵션을 켤 때만 권한을 요청하며 다른 용도로는 사용하지 않습니다. 권한이 없으면 직접 스크롤하는 동안 ishare가 캡처합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With automatic scrolling, ishare scrolls the area you selected by sending scroll events to it, so long pages are captured without scrolling by hand. macOS lists this permission under Accessibility. ishare asks for it only when you turn this on and uses it for nothing else. Without it, you scroll yourself and ishare captures as you go."
          }
        },
