    "ishare creates the album if it doesn't exist. Apps can't create shared albums or add to them, so captures go into a regular album that you can share from Photos. Photos uploads have no link; the history keeps a reference to the photo." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "ishare creates the album if it doesn't exist. Apps can't create shared albums or add to them, so captures go into a regular album that you can share from Photos. Photos uploads have no link; the history keeps a reference to the photo."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يُنشئ ishare الألبوم إذا لم يكن موجودًا. لا يمكن للتطبيقات إنشاء ألبومات مشتركة أو الإضافة إليها، لذا تُضاف اللقطات إلى ألبوم عادي يمكنك مشاركته من Photos. لا تحتوي عمليات الرفع إلى Photos على رابط؛ ويحتفظ السجل بمرجع إلى الصورة."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "ishare creates the album if it doesn't exist. Apps can't create shared albums or add to them, so captures go into a regular album that you can share from Photos. Photos uploads have no link; the history keeps a reference to the photo."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "ishare creates the album if it doesn't exist. Apps can't create shared albums or add to them, so captures go into a regular album that you can share from Photos. Photos uploads have no link; the history keeps a reference to the photo."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "ishare creates the album if it doesn't exist. Apps can't create shared albums or add to them, so captures go into a regular album that you can share from Photos. Photos uploads have no link; the history keeps a reference to the photo."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ishare erstellt das Album, falls es noch nicht existiert. Apps können keine geteilten Alben erstellen oder ihnen etwas hinzufügen, daher landen Aufnahmen in einem normalen Album, das du in Fotos teilen kannst. Uploads in Fotos haben keinen Link; der Verlauf speichert einen Verweis auf das Foto."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "ishare creates the album if it doesn't exist. Apps can't create shared albums or add to them, so captures go into a regular album that you can share from Photos. Photos uploads have no link; the history keeps a reference to the photo."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ishare crea el álbum si no existe. Las apps no pueden crear álbumes compartidos ni añadir contenido a ellos, así que las capturas van a un álbum normal que puedes compartir desde Fotos. Las subidas a Fotos no tienen enlace; el historial guarda una referencia a la foto."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "ishare creates the album if it doesn't exist. Apps can't create shared albums or add to them, so captures go into a regular album that you can share from Photos. Photos uploads have no link; the history keeps a reference to the photo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ishare crée l'album s'il n'existe pas. Les apps ne peuvent ni créer d'albums partagés ni y ajouter du contenu : les captures sont donc placées dans un album ordinaire que vous pouvez partager depuis Photos. Les envois vers Photos n'ont pas de lien ; l'historique conserve une référence à la photo."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "ishare creates the album if it doesn't exist. Apps can't create shared albums or add to them, so captures go into a regular album that you can share from Photos. Photos uploads have no link; the history keeps a reference to the photo."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "ishare creates the album if it doesn't exist. Apps can't create shared albums or add to them, so captures go into a regular album that you can share from Photos. Photos uploads have no link; the history keeps a reference to the photo."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "ishare creates the album if it doesn't exist. Apps can't create shared albums or add to them, so captures go into a regular album that you can share from Photos. Photos uploads have no link; the history keeps a reference to the photo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "アルバムが存在しない場合はishareが作成します。Appは共有アルバムの作成や追加ができないため、キャプチャは通常のアルバムに入ります。そのアルバムは“写真”から共有できます。“写真”へのアップロードにはリンクがなく、履歴には写真への参照が保存されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "앨범이 없으면 ishare가 생성합니다. 앱은 공유 앨범을 만들거나 공유 앨범에 추가할 수 없으므로 캡처는 일반 앨범에 저장되며, 이 앨범은 사진 앱에서 공유할 수 있습니다. 사진 업로드에는 링크가 없으며, 기록에는 사진에 대한 참조가 보관됩니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
