            "value" : "ishare creates the album if it doesn't exist. Apps can't create shared albums or add to them, so captures go into a regular album that you can share from Photos. Photos uploads have no link; the history keeps a reference to the photo."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ishare, albüm yoksa oluşturur. Uygulamalar paylaşılan albüm oluşturamaz veya bunlara ekleme yapamaz; bu yüzden yakalamalar Fotoğraflar'dan paylaşabileceğiniz normal bir albüme gider. Fotoğraflar yüklemelerinin bağlantısı yoktur; geçmiş, fotoğrafa bir başvuru tutar."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Якщо альбому немає, ishare створить його. Програми не можуть створювати спільні альбоми чи додавати до них, тому знімки потрапляють у звичайний альбом, яким можна поділитися з програми «Фото». Вивантаження у «Фото» не мають посилання; в історії зберігається посилання на фото."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "ishare creates the album if it doesn't exist. Apps can't create shared albums or add to them, so captures go into a regular album that you can share from Photos. Photos uploads have no link; the history keeps a reference to the photo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果相簿不存在，ishare 会创建它。App 无法创建共享相簿或向其中添加内容，因此捕获内容会存入普通相簿，你可以在“照片”中共享该相簿。上传到“照片”不会生成链接；历史记录会保留对该照片的引用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "ishare creates the album if it doesn't exist. Apps can't create shared albums or add to them, so captures go into a regular album that you can share from Photos. Photos uploads have no link; the history keeps a reference to the photo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ishare deletes uploads once they're older than this, checks daily and after your Mac wakes, and never deletes uploads you mark “Keep Forever” in your history." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "ishare deletes uploads once they're older than this, checks daily and after your Mac wakes, and never deletes uploads you mark “Keep Forever” in your history."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يحذف ishare الملفات المرفوعة عندما تصبح أقدم من هذه المدة، ويتحقق يوميًا وبعد تنبيه جهاز Mac، ولا يحذف أبدًا الملفات التي تضع عليها علامة “الاحتفاظ للأبد” في السجل."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
